{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05593","headline":"九日陪润州邵使君登北固山 · 张子容","name":"九日陪润州邵使君登北固山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五马向西椒，重阳坐丽谯。\n徐州带绿水，楚国在青霄。\n张幕连江树，开筵接海潮。\n凌云词客语，回雪无人娇。\n梅福惭仙吏，羊公赏下僚。\n新丰酒旧美，况是菊花朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张子容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}